sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Engineer / User
    participant Harness as Runtime Harness (Claude / agy)
    participant Hook as Context Guard & Model Router
    participant Router as using-swe-skills
    participant Primary as Primary Session (pro/Sonnet)
    participant Worker as Worker Subagent (flash/Haiku)

    User->>Harness: /eng implement retry logic across API
    Harness->>Hook: PreInvocation / UserPromptSubmit check
    Hook-->>Harness: Context healthy (<70%, <50 steps)
    Harness->>Router: Route task & size scope (Tool/App/System)
    Router-->>Primary: Load planning-with-contracts & designing-testable-seams
    Primary->>Primary: Draft PLAN.md with contracts & seams
    
    Note over Primary: Phase transition: Planning -> Execution
    Primary->>Primary: Evict planning skills from active memory
    
    Primary->>Hook: invoke_subagent (build/test verification)
    Hook->>Hook: PreToolUse intercepts & confirms Model=flash
    Hook->>Worker: Dispatch worker in isolated workspace
    
    Worker->>Worker: cargo test -q / pytest -q (hundreds of lines absorbed)
    Worker->>Worker: Fix compile error in scratchpad
    Worker-->>Primary: Return <=10 lines: pass status + clean diff
    
    Primary->>Primary: Run final quiet gate: cargo test -q
    Primary->>User: Task complete with verifiable evidence
